  "notes": "Frozen policy battery (S4.3). Each case is a fixture workspace, a request, the tool script a competent agent follows, and the eval check that decides the reward. 'split' is frozen with the version: heldout cases are never trained on. Editing any case yields a new version; scores of different versions never compare.",
